    "nextLabel": "1006001000512"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "相手の立場になって\r\n考えること",
    "nextLabel": "1006001000513"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000510030,
    "label": "1006001000511",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "仲良くなるために、距離を置いてしまうのかい……？\r\n……なるほど、常に一緒にいるだけが友情ではないね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100051/1006001000510030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000510040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私はつい相手とともに何かをすることばかり考えてしまうが、\r\nそういう考えもあるんだね。新鮮な心持ちだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100051/1006001000510040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000510050,
    "label": "1006001000512",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……私もそう思うよ\r\n相手が楽しめれば自分も楽しくなる",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100051/1006001000510050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000510060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これが仲を深めるということの素晴らしさだ\r\nアナタも同じ考えでうれしいよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100051/1006001000510060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000510070,
    "label": "1006001000513",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、他人を理解することはとても大事だね\r\n人と関わる上で、重要な能力と言ってもいい",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
